+# Retail MAT opacity scan (2026-10-20)
+
+The current `Data/NAP/Material/` tree contains 110 MAT files and 1,024 parsed
+material definitions. The scan used the Client's `UtfLoader.LoadResourceFile`
+and `MaterialMap` parser path; all 110 files parsed without errors.
+
+| Check | Count |
+|---|---:|
+| Materials with an `Oc` field | 24 |
+| Materials with `Oc < 1` | 23 |
+| `DetailMap*` materials with `Oc` | 0 |
+| Partial-opacity materials whose type includes `Ot` | 23 |
+| Partial-opacity materials with embedded DXT1 diffuse data | 5 |
+
+The observed partial-opacity types are `DcDtOcOt`, `DcDtOcOtTwo`, and
+`DcDtBtOcOtTwo`. These five stock materials contain diffuse DXT1 payloads in
+their MAT-embedded TXM resources:
+
+| MAT file | Material | `Oc` | Diffuse texture |
+|---|---|---:|---|
+| `solar/solar_mat_dockable01.mat` | `glass` | 0.5 | `glass_generic.tga` |
+| `solar/solar_mat_dockable01.mat` | `planet_glass_window` | 0.5 | `pygar_metal_deck_g.tga` |
+| `solar/asteroid_dock.mat` | `metal_deck_g.tga` | 0.6 | `metal_deck_g.tga` |
+| `solar/solar_mat_mbase.mat` | `metal_deck_g.tga` | 0.6 | `metal_deck_g.tga` |
+| `solar/solar_mat_co_base.mat` | `metal_deck_g.tga` | 0.6 | `metal_deck_g.tga` |
+
+The legacy `GetDxt1()` heuristic suppresses alpha sorting for binary DXT1
+cutouts. Before patch 2492, the same heuristic kept these `Ot` materials in the
+opaque pass even though their fractional material opacity enables normal
+source-over blending. Patch 2492 now includes `Oc * OpacityMultiplier < 1` in
+`BasicMaterial.IsTransparent`, fixing the confirmed retail classification
+overlap. The four unit tests cover fractional opacity, opaque opacity, runtime
+opacity multipliers, and `Oc` without its enabling flag. A live scene proving
+the resulting draw order and visual appearance remains outstanding.
